[38;2;246;130;31manyr[0m – point any coding agent at AnyRouter

Everyday
  anyr login                     Sign in (browser; --device on a server)
  anyr chat "<prompt>"           Ask a model; --json for scripts
  anyr models                    Browse models; `models use <id>` sets the default
  anyr claude                    Launch Claude Code (also codex, grok, opencode, pi, pool)
  anyr relay                     Serve this machine's local models
  anyr artifact publish <file>   Publish a page or folder to a URL
  anyr usage                     Credits remaining

Examples
  $ anyr claude --model anyrouter/free[1m]
  $ git diff | anyr chat "Review this" -
  $ anyr models --free

More
  anyr help --all        every command, grouped
  anyr help agents       for scripts and agents: --json, exit codes
  anyr <command> --help

